==Kikuyu==

===Etymology===
Hinde (1904) records ''kurega'' as an equivalent of English {{m|en|refuse}} in “Jogowini dialect” of Kikuyu, listing also “Nganyawa dialect” (spoken then in [[w:Kitui County|Kitui District]]) of {{cog|kam|gulea}} as its equivalent.<ref name="hh1904">Hinde, Hildegarde (1904). [https://archive.org/details/vocabulariesofka00hindiala ''Vocabularies of the Kamba and Kikuyu languages of East Africa''], pp. 50&ndash;51. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press.</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɾɛɣa/|lang=ki}}

===Verb===
{{head|ki|verb}} (''infinitive'' {{l|ki|kũrega}})

